{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-24", "prepared_on": "2026-11-24", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-24</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic launches Claude Ship, letting AI agents review, fix, and approve code changes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Ship，AI 代理人可自動審查、修正並核准程式碼變更</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As AI-generated code piles up, Anthropic's new developer tools aim to remove another bottleneck by letting agents handle routine approvals.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨著 AI 產出的程式碼愈來愈多，Anthropic 讓代理人處理例行的審查與核准，目前開放 Claude Team 與 Enterprise 用戶測試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-launches-claude-ship-letting-ai-agents-review-fix-and-approve-code-changes/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Nvidia reverses course and brings Jensen Huang back as CEO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia 改變決定，黃仁勳重回執行長職位</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The stunning reversal, coming 11 days after Huang's resignation, was supported by senior officials in the U.S. government.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">黃仁勳離職 11 天後復職，美國政府高層也表態支持，他並承諾成為更好的執行長。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-reverses-course-and-brings-jensen-huang-back-as-ceo/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> CrowdStrike to acquire Zscaler for $43.9B, the largest cybersecurity deal on record<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">CrowdStrike 以 439 億美元併購 Zscaler，創資安界交易紀錄</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CrowdStrike and Zscaler announced an all-stock deal valued at $43.9 billion, moving CrowdStrike further into network security.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">兩家公司宣布全股票交易，總價 439 億美元，CrowdStrike 藉此跨足網路安全領域。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180740\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI and Cisco introduce Shirudo<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 與思科推出 Shirudo</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Shirudo is an open-source runtime for Linux that helps teams protect running systems while they roll out patches.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Shirudo 是開源的 Linux 執行環境防護技術，運用 AI 代理人，讓企業在修補程式釋出前也能保護運作中的系統，且不必重啟。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-shirudo\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> States sue SpaceX to stop Grok from generating child sex images, revenge porn<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">多州起訴 SpaceX，要求阻止 Grok 生成兒童性影像與報復性色情內容</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">X says every Grok output is screened, but state attorneys general say Grok is still producing CSAM. Oregon and Virginia filed separate suits.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">X 表示所有 Grok 輸出都經過篩檢，但州檢察長指稱 Grok 仍在產出違法內容。奧勒岡與維吉尼亞分別提告。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/11/states-sue-spacex-to-stop-grok-from-generating-child-sex-images-revenge-porn/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Amazon snaps up Decart's AI optimization tech for $7.5B as it prepares to sell Trainium chips<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">亞馬遜以 75 億美元收購 Decart 的 AI 最佳化技術，為銷售 Trainium 晶片鋪路</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon is acquiring Decart's AI optimization technology and research team in a reported $7.5 billion deal.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，亞馬遜將以 75 億美元取得 Decart 的 AI 最佳化技術與研究團隊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/amazon-snaps-up-decarts-ai-optimization-tech-for-7-5b-as-it-prepares-to-sell-trainium-chips/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Rackspace Spot breached, attackers could read secrets inside customer clusters<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">雲端服務 Rackspace Spot 遭入侵，攻擊者可讀取客戶叢集內的機密資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Leaked credentials on Rackspace's managed Kubernetes platform let attackers impersonate users, create unauthorized Pods and read Kubernetes Secrets.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">憑證外洩使攻擊者得以冒用身分建立未授權 Pod、讀取 Secrets。管理主控台中斷許久，11 月 22 日凌晨才恢復。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180726\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google Search's AI Mode can now tap into Drive and Wallet for more personalized responses<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 搜尋 AI 模式可串接 Drive 與 Wallet，提供更個人化的回答</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google is bringing Personal Intelligence in AI Mode to Drive, Wallet and the Gemini app, leveraging user data already in its ecosystem.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 將 AI 模式的個人化智慧延伸到 Drive、Wallet 與 Gemini app，善用既有生態系中的使用者資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/google-searchs-ai-mode-can-now-tap-into-drive-and-wallet-for-more-personalized-responses/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Finding faster quantum algorithms with agents and formal verification<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">以代理人與形式化驗證尋找更快的量子演算法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind uses agent teams and formal verification to improve quantum algorithms for fusion and chemistry.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind 運用代理人團隊與形式化驗證，改進應用於核融合與化學領域的量子演算法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/finding-faster-quantum-algorithms-with-agents-and-formal-verification/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Sierra doubles valuation to $30B within six months as demand for AI in CX takes off<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Sierra 半年內估值翻倍至 300 億美元，客服 AI 需求大增</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sierra, co-founded by former Salesforce co-CEO Bret Taylor, raised $1.75 billion in a Series F round.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">由前 Salesforce 共同執行長 Bret Taylor 共同創辦的 Sierra，完成 17.5 億美元 F 輪募資。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/sierra-doubles-valuation-to-30b-within-six-months-as-demand-for-ai-in-cx-takes-off/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}